  id: BloodReaverSignature
  skillName: "Hi\u1EC7n Th\xE2n T\xE0n S\xE1t"
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  skilDesc: "\"H\xE0nh \u0111\u1ED9ng: N\u1ED5 tung to\xE0n b\u1ED9 s\u1ED1 m\xE1u
    hi\u1EC7n c\xF3 (ch\u1EEBa l\u1EA1i 1 HP) g\xE2y s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng AoE
    c\u1EF1c l\u1EDBn xung quanh d\u1EF1a tr\xEAn s\u1ED1 m\xE1u hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i\n\nHi\u1EC7u
    \u1EE9ng: Trong 5s ti\u1EBFp theo, Chris Don nh\u1EADn hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng B\u1EA5t
    T\u1EED (Invulnerable) v\xE0 t\u0103ng g\u1EA5p \u0111\xF4i hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng
    t\u1EEB Passive.\nKh\xED k\u1EBFt th\xFAc hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng, n\u1EBFu kh\xF4ng
    s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng skill trong kho\u1EA3ng th\u1EDDi gian n\xE0y, \u0111\u1EB7t
    m\xE1u c\u1EE7a Chris Don v\u1EC1 50% m\xE1u t\u1ED1i \u0111a.\""
